Steps to memorize for exam
1. Open Eclipse
   
   Open Eclipse IDE for Enterprise Java and Web Developers.
2. Create Maven Project
   
   Click File → New → Maven Project.
3. Select Archetype
   
   Search quickstart → Select maven-archetype-quickstart → Version 1.4 → Click Next.
4. Enter Project Details
   
   - Group Id: SE
   - Artifact Id: MavenJava
   
   Click Finish.
5. Open Java File
   
   MavenJava → src/main/java → SE.MavenJava → App.java
6. Execute Maven Commands
   
   Right-click project → Run As → Maven Build
   
   In Goals, enter:
   
   bash     clean install test     
   
   Click Apply → Run.
   
   You can also run Maven Clean, Maven Install, and Maven Test individually if required.
7. Run Java Application
   
   Right-click App.java → Run As → Java Application.
8. Check Console Output
   
   text     Hello World!     
   
   Maven build should show BUILD SUCCESS.



